<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="pypi:repository-version" content="{{simple_api_version}}">
<title>reposnake projects</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/index.css">
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Python package repository</p>
<h1>reposnake</h1>
<p class="lede">reposnake is a small package repository for Python distribution files. Python clients can install from this root Simple API, while publishers upload packages through the Twine-compatible <code>/legacy/</code> endpoint.</p>
</section>
<section class="usage" aria-labelledby="usage-title">
<h2 id="usage-title">Using this repository</h2>
<div class="usage-grid">
<div>
<h3>Install Python packages</h3>
<pre><code>pip install --extra-index-url http://localhost:8080 example-package</code></pre>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Upload with Twine</h3>
<pre><code>twine upload \
  --repository-url http://localhost:8080/legacy/ \
  --username __token__ \
  --password "$UPLOAD_JWT" \
  dist/*</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
<p class="note">Downloads are public. Uploads use a JWT supplied as the Twine password.</p>
</section>
<section class="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
<h2 id="projects-title">Projects</h2>
{{#if projects}}
{{#each projects}}
<a class="project-link" href="/{{normalized_name}}/">{{name}}</a>
{{/each}}
{{else}}
<p class="empty">No Python projects have been uploaded yet.</p>
{{/if}}
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
